---@class CisRequire
--- `Cis.require(name)` RAISES on an unknown name rather than answering nil:
--- every other `Cis.*` call answers `false, reason` because the caller may
--- legitimately be probing, and a silent nil here is a nil index three frames
--- deeper in the caller, with no name in it.
---@param name string
---@return table
function CisRequire(name) end

